{"page":315,"verses":[{"verse_key":"20:52","surah":20,"ayah":52,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ عِلْمُهَا عِندَ رَبِّى فِى كِتَـٰبٍ ۖ لَّا يَضِلُّ رَبِّى وَلَا يَنسَى","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Moses said, ‘My Lord alone has knowledge of them, all in a record; my Lord does not err or forget.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"20:52"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عِلْمُهَا","en_gloss":"Its knowledge","transliteration":"ʿil'muhā","verse_key":"20:52"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"(is) with","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"20:52"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبِّى","en_gloss":"my Lord","transliteration":"rabbī","verse_key":"20:52"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"20:52"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كِتَـٰبٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"a Record","transliteration":"kitābin","verse_key":"20:52"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"20:52"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَضِلُّ","en_gloss":"errs","transliteration":"yaḍillu","verse_key":"20:52"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رَبِّى","en_gloss":"my Lord","transliteration":"rabbī","verse_key":"20:52"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"20:52"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَنسَى","en_gloss":"forgets","transliteration":"yansā","verse_key":"20:52"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٥٢","en_gloss":"(52)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"20:52"}]},{"verse_key":"20:53","surah":20,"ayah":53,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى جَعَلَ لَكُمُ ٱلْأَرْضَ مَهْدًا وَسَلَكَ لَكُمْ فِيهَا سُبُلًا وَأَنزَلَ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءً فَأَخْرَجْنَا بِهِۦٓ أَزْوَٰجًا مِّن نَّبَاتٍ شَتَّىٰ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It was He who spread out the earth for you and traced routes in it. He sent down water from the sky. With that water We bring forth every kind of plant,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"The One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"20:53"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَعَلَ","en_gloss":"made","transliteration":"jaʿala","verse_key":"20:53"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَكُمُ","en_g