"(57)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"20:57"}]},{"verse_key":"20:58","surah":20,"ayah":58,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَنَأْتِيَنَّكَ بِسِحْرٍ مِّثْلِهِۦ فَٱجْعَلْ بَيْنَنَا وَبَيْنَكَ مَوْعِدًا لَّا نُخْلِفُهُۥ نَحْنُ وَلَآ أَنتَ مَكَانًا سُوًى","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We will confront you with sorcery to match your own: make an appointment between us which neither of us will fail to keep, in a mutually agreeable place.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَنَأْتِيَنَّكَ","en_gloss":"Then we will surely produce for you","transliteration":"falanatiyannaka","verse_key":"20:58"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِسِحْرٍۢ","en_gloss":"magic","transliteration":"bisiḥ'rin","verse_key":"20:58"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِّثْلِهِۦ","en_gloss":"like it","transliteration":"mith'lihi","verse_key":"20:58"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَٱجْعَلْ","en_gloss":"So make","transliteration":"fa-ij'ʿal","verse_key":"20:58"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَيْنَنَا","en_gloss":"between us","transliteration":"baynanā","verse_key":"20:58"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَبَيْنَكَ","en_gloss":"and between you","transliteration":"wabaynaka","verse_key":"20:58"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَوْعِدًۭا","en_gloss":"an appointment","transliteration":"mawʿidan","verse_key":"20:58"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"20:58"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نُخْلِفُهُۥ","en_gloss":"we will fail it","transliteration":"nukh'lifuhu","verse_key":"20:58"},{"pos":10,"ar":"نَحْنُ","en_gloss":"[we]","transliteration":"naḥnu","verse_key":"20:58"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"20:58"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَنتَ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"anta","verse_key":"20:58"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَكَانًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) a place","transliteration":"makānan","verse_key":"20:58"},{"pos":14,"ar":"سُوًۭى","en_gloss":"even","transliteration":"suwan","verse_key":"20:58"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٥٨","en_gloss":"(58)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"20:58"}]},{"verse_key":"20:59","surah":20,"ayah":59,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ مَوْعِدُكُمْ يَوْمُ ٱلزِّينَةِ